        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml Diagrama de Despliegue - Cordillera Pets\n\ntitle Diagrama de Despliegue - Cordillera Pets eCommerce\\nInfraestructura DigitalOcean\n\nskinparam {\n    backgroundColor #FFFFFF\n    defaultFontSize 11\n    ArrowColor #2C3E50\n    NodeBorderColor #3498DB\n    NodeBackgroundColor #EBF5FB\n    ComponentBorderColor #27AE60\n    ComponentBackgroundColor #E8F8F5\n    DatabaseBorderColor #E67E22\n    DatabaseBackgroundColor #FEF5E7\n}\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; CLIENTE\n&#39; ============================================\nactor \&quot;Usuario\&quot; as user\nnode \&quot;Navegador Web\&quot; as browser &lt;&lt;device&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; DIGITALOCEAN CLOUD\n&#39; ============================================\ncloud \&quot;DigitalOcean Cloud\&quot; as do_cloud {\n\n    node \&quot;App Server\\n(Droplet Ubuntu)\&quot; as appserver &lt;&lt;server&gt;&gt; {\n        component \&quot;Nginx\&quot; as nginx\n        component \&quot;Gunicorn\&quot; as gunicorn\n        component \&quot;Django 5.2\&quot; as django {\n            artifact \&quot;apps.ventas\&quot; as ventas\n            artifact \&quot;apps.dashboard\&quot; as dashboard\n            artifact \&quot;apps.carrito\&quot; as carrito\n        }\n    }\n\n    database \&quot;PostgreSQL 15\\n(Managed Database)\&quot; as postgres &lt;&lt;database&gt;&gt; {\n        storage \&quot;cordillerapets_pgdb\&quot; as db\n    }\n\n    cloud \&quot;Spaces\\n(Object Storage)\&quot; as spaces &lt;&lt;storage&gt;&gt; {\n        folder \&quot;Imágenes de Productos\&quot; as images\n        component \&quot;CDN\&quot; as cdn\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; SERVICIOS EXTERNOS\n&#39; ============================================\ncloud \&quot;Transbank\\nWebpay Plus\&quot; as transbank &lt;&lt;external&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; CONEXIONES\n&#39; ============================================\nuser --&gt; browser\nbrowser --&gt; nginx : \&quot;HTTPS\\n(Port 443)\&quot;\nnginx --&gt; gunicorn : \&quot;Proxy\\n(Port 8000)\&quot;\ngunicorn --&gt; django : \&quot;WSGI\&quot;\n\ndjango --&gt; postgres : \&quot;psycopg\\n(SSL)\&quot;\ndjango --&gt; spaces : \&quot;boto3\\n(S3 API)\&quot;\ndjango --&gt; transbank : \&quot;API REST\\n(Pagos)\&quot;\n\nbrowser --&gt; cdn : \&quot;GET\\nImágenes\&quot;\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; NOTAS\n&#39; ============================================\nnote right of appserver\n  **Stack:**\n  - Ubuntu 22.04\n  - Python 3.12\n  - Django 5.2\n  - Gunicorn WSGI\n  - Nginx reverse proxy\nend note\n\nnote bottom of postgres\n  - Conexión SSL\n  - Backups automáticos\n  - Connection pooling\nend note\n\nnote bottom of spaces\n  - Compatible S3\n  - CDN integrado\n  - Region: nyc3\nend note\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="LdMkGKXUisOO05JQg2mE-1">
